The board is "G".
The hand is "GGGGG".
The symbol is character 0 of board.
The boardlast is the last position of board.
The count is boardlast plus 1.
The handlast is the last position of hand.
The needed is 3 minus count.
The matching is 0.
For every spot from 0 to handlast.
If character spot of hand is symbol, add 1 to matching.
If matching is at least needed, stop.


If needed is less than 1, show 0, otherwise if matching is at least needed, show needed, otherwise show -1.
